==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|signif|i|ed}}

# To give (something) a [[meaning]] or an [[importance]].
# To [[show]] one’s [[intention]]s with a [[sign]] etc.
#: ''The government should '''signify''' to the Protestants of Ireland that want of silver is not to be remedied.'' &mdash; Swift.
# To [[mean]]; to [[betoken]].
#: ''A tale / Told by an idiot, full of sound and fury, / '''Signifying''' nothing.'' &mdash; Shakespeare.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|betoken}}

